# action_type_lock.golden -- SsbActionType wire-tag lock file
# Generated by: cargo test -p elai-orchestrator --test action_type_lock regen_golden_file -- --ignored --nocapture
# Format: <4-digit ordinal> <wire_tag>
# Ordinal is the index in the ALPHABETICALLY-sorted list of as_sql_str() values.
# Alphabetical sort gives stable PR diffs: adding a variant only inserts new lines and shifts ordinals from the insertion point forward.
# Append-only contract: removing or renaming a wire tag requires adding a #[serde(rename = "<old>")] shim AND updating this file in the same commit.
# 8th lockstep site for SsbActionType (alongside enum / SQL CHECK / as_sql_str / from_str / SsbPayload / action_type() / variant tests).
# Last regenerated: rerun this test to refresh; review the diff before committing.
# Total variants: 562
#
